\f0\b0                                                                      \
                                                                                                              \
  
\f1\b Similarity:
\f0\b0  Ledger's \cf3 scheduleModelDrivenUIRefresh()\cf2  pattern (guard flag, \cf3 DispatchQueue.main.async\cf2 , reset\
  flag, call refresh) is identical in structure to SharedUI's existing \cf3 schedulePaneStateSync()\cf2  and to how     \
